OL,3,GNEWSAVacant community centre to get
OL,4,A#400,000 upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FUp to #400,000 is to be spent on
OL,7,Fupgrading an empty community centre to
OL,8,Fhelp it appeal to new occupiers.
OL,10,FCity of Wolverhampton Council said it
OL,11,Fhas agreed to carry out work on
OL,12,FPortobello Community Centre in Hill
OL,13,FRoad, Willenhall, so any community
OL,14,Fgroups taking it over would "have a
OL,15,Fstrong base to start from."
OL,17,FThe building was put on the market for
OL,18,Fa potential community asset transfer
OL,19,F(CAT) deal in 2025 but interested
OL,20,Ftenants were "put off" by the condition
OL,21,Fof the building despite "substantial
OL,22,Finterest", it said.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
